1. Do NOT reward decorative buzzwords ("we will use ML/AI to analyze the results") on standard clinical or laboratory protocols where classical statistics (ANCOVA, mixed models, survival regression) or fixed dosing/stimulation already suffice.
2. Conversely, DO identify genuine AI leverage when a concrete scientific or engineering bottleneck in the card's text is materially unlocked by AI, ONLY within `eligible_modes`:
